Scope
  * Milestone B: orbit/zoom/reset camera verified; HUD labels ignore mouse so empty-space
    drags reach the camera while buttons still consume taps.
  * Milestone C: the world reveals a distinct ward stone per Chapter 01 level, warms its
    ground, and shows Nox the companion on chapter completion; resume from a save restores
    exactly the matching revealed prefix.
  * Milestone D: per-face readiness readout — every face is named and shown as "solid" or
    "N shades", objective faces are marked, so the player can read puzzle mastery across the
    whole cube, not only the win condition.
  * capture_frames.gd preserves and restores the player save (it plays the chapter for real).

Limitations: rendering on a virtual X server only. There is no physical Android device in
this environment, so this is NOT a device playtest; the APK is an artifact, not a store build.

